sequenceDiagram
  participant E as project, editors
  participant S as previewSync
  participant P as Preview
  participant W as worker
  E->>P: project change: update(files)
  Note over P: LatestOnly
  P->>W: compile
  W-->>P: pages + diagnostics
  Note over P: page list: swap pages whose hash changed
  P-->>E: onDidRender, onDidChangeDiagnostics (only if no newer update)
  Note over P: click: px → pt
  P->>W: click
  P->>S: onDidClickPage
  S->>E: select the source
  E->>S: edit, selection moved away
  S->>P: clearClickHighlight
  E->>S: cursor
  S->>P: reveal
  P->>W: cursor
  Note over P: scroll if off-screen
  E->>S: selection (60 ms at rest)
  S->>P: setSelectionHighlight
  P->>W: boxes
  Note over P: shading
